# M4 alerts rehearsal — fault injection against the live agent

`docs/FINAL_PUSH_PLAN.md` MILESTONE M4, step 7. Run 2026-09-18 against the
live Droplet `137.184.4.22`, one day ahead of the plan's placeholder date
(`2026-09-19`) — named for when it actually happened. Six turns via the
public agent API, `X-Copilot-Fault` header (`agent/app/api.py:74-78`, honored
because `fault_injection: bool` is enabled on this deployment — independently
confirmed by the earlier `--fault model` load-test control run). PHI-free:
synthetic cohort af-cohort-v1 only, no record content below, correlation ids
and conversation ids only.

